{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/deployment-environments/runners/core","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:06.056Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/deployment-environments/runners/core/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/deployment-environments/runners/core/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nThis image contains the core components required to deploy IaC templates with Azure Deployment Environments (ADE). By using this image, you can configure various different steps and services to prepare and deploy your Infrastructure-as-code (IaC) templates using your preferred IaC provider, along with executing any additional shell scripts necessary for your deployment. You can also build off of this image to customize your deployment and deletion scenarios.\n\n## Featured Tags\n- `latest` ```docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/deployment-environments/runners/core:latest``` \n\n## All Available Tags\n- `latest`\n- `2.3.3-preview`\n  \n## Usage\n\nTo base a custom image off of the core image, please use the following line in your Dockerfile:\n```\n    FROM mcr.microsoft.com/public/deployment-environments/runners/core:{IMAGE_VERSION}\n```\n\nThen, you can reference our existing available images at our ADE GitHub repo to see how you can specify or modify certain shell scripts for deployment and deletion operations [here](https://github.com/Azure/deployment-environments/tree/main/Runner-Images/README.md).\n\n## Support\n\n[File an issue](https://github.com/Azure/deployment-environments/issues)\n\n[Additional Documentation about ADE](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/deployment-environments/)\n\n## License\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\nSee license terms [here](https://github.com/Azure/deployment-environments/blob/main/LICENSE).\n\nFor more information visit the [MAR Legal Notice](https://github.com/microsoft/containerregistry/blob/main/legal/Container-Images-Legal-Notice.md).","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-22T20:46:34.5249231+00:00","categories":["Base Images","Application Infrastructure"],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[{"name":"licence","url":"https://github.com/Azure/deployment-environments/blob/main/LICENSE"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"76K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:18d6acb604d4bca078f8b8b33ea857d73eea62518c5635f5db97b285a196d3ac","pushed":"2026-09-22T20:46:35.0000000+00:00","size":6351,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4.5.0-preview","digest":"sha256:18d6acb604d4bca078f8b8b33ea857d73eea62518c5635f5db97b285a196d3ac","pushed":"2026-09-22T20:45:40.0000000+00:00","size":6351,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4.4.0-preview","digest":"sha256:0146f2afc24910cffa7d95eb17c21fc5ff6a64516e2cdbfe32e5d77bf4b2dd23","pushed":"2025-12-04T18:36:09.0000000+00:00","size":6355,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4.3.0-preview","digest":"sha256:21ed722d909f9b411cbdb232d4ce01db76b4dfab549350837d22250c87c3ca8a","pushed":"2025-10-01T22:06:07.0000000+00:00","size":6350,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4.2.0-preview","digest":"sha256:3ddf1af6d2b1d213163940b693a9858f4536563dee7de8caaed6705868e0c9f7","pushed":"2025-06-25T00:11:05.0000000+00:00","size":6355,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4.1.0-preview","digest":"sha256:506abca51a6d4a387df69ee35cdfbfbd